  "worked_solution": "The word \"and\" is represented by the symbol \"$∧.$\"\n\nNote that the given sentence is a shortened version of the following full sentence:\n\n$8$ is a natural number and $8$ is divisible by $4.$\n\nSo, the sentence reads\n\n$$\n{{8\\text{ is a natural number}}_{⏟}}_{P}\\,{{\\text{and}}_{⏟}}_{∧}\\,{{8\\text{ is divisible by }4}_{⏟}}_{Q},\n$$\n\nthat is, $P∧Q.$",
